<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:600d32f2-df4a-411a-bdc6-6d77bb44cb33" title="The XML Files" data-linktype="external">The XML Files:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:600d32f2-df4a-411a-bdc6-6d77bb44cb33" title="XML Encoding, DTDs and Namespaces, Binary Data, Namespace Identifiers, and More" data-linktype="external">XML Encoding, DTDs and Namespaces, Binary Data, Namespace Identifiers, and More</a></p>
